<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In His hand are the deep places of the earth.</l><l>The strength of the hills is His also,</l><l>The sea is His, and He made it,</l><l>And His hands formed the dry land,</l><l>And His hands formed the dry land.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O come, let us worship and bow down;</l><l>Let us kneel before the Lord, our Maker.</l><l>For He is our God, and we are</l><l>The people of His pasture,</l><l>And the sheep of His hand.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
